{"id": "s-0201", "domain": "skill tree", "names": ["Slash", "Fireball", "Heal"], "text": "I'm designing a skill tree for my indie game. Make Fireball red, Heal green, and stick a star called Ultimate above Slash. Then run a line from Slash to it, no arrowhead, because the unlock goes both ways. How many stars exist now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Fireball", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Heal", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "star", "name": "Ultimate", "position": "above", "anchor": "Slash"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Slash", "to": "$new", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "star"}}]}
{"id": "s-0202", "domain": "subway map", "names": ["Central", "Harbor", "Airport"], "text": "The red line runs Central, Harbor, Airport. Wire them in that order with arrows going both ways, since trains run in both directions. Central is the interchange so I want it bigger than the other two. Is Airport connected to Central directly?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Central,Harbor,Airport", "pairing": "chain", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Central"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Airport", "anchor": "Central"}}]}
{"id": "s-0203", "domain": "newsroom", "names": ["Reporter", "Editor", "Desk"], "text": "the reporter files to the editor, the editor sends it on to the desk. draw it pls. also mke the Editor orange coz he is always the buisy one, and put the Desk at the bottom of the canvas. whats the path from Reporter to Desk?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Reporter,Editor,Desk", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Editor", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Desk", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Reporter", "to": "Desk"}}]}
{"id": "s-0204", "domain": "orchestra seating", "names": ["Violins", "Cellos", "Brass"], "text": "Violins go on the left and Brass on the right, as always. Cellos sit in the middle, in front. Spread the three evenly, line them up, and tint the Brass gold. Who sits rightmost?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Violins", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Brass", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Cellos", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Violins,Cellos,Brass", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Violins,Cellos,Brass", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Brass", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "rightmost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0205", "domain": "security operations", "names": ["Alert", "Analyst", "Case"], "text": "An Alert fires, an Analyst picks it up, and a Case is opened. Link them as a chain, but dashed between the Analyst and the Case, because it is manual. Make the Alert red and tiny. Do you see a cycle anywhere, I hope not?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Alert,Analyst,Case", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Analyst", "to": "Case", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Alert", "color": "red", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0206", "domain": "pizza shop", "names": ["Dough", "Sauce", "Cheese"], "text": "Layer the toppings: Dough first, then Sauce, then Cheese on top. I mean stack them in a column. Colour the Sauce red and the Cheese yellow. Oh, and nudge the whole thing right by 40 pixels.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Dough,Sauce,Cheese", "layout": "column"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Sauce", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cheese", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "mention(quantifier=all)", "direction": "right", "distance": "40"}}]}
{"id": "s-0207", "domain": "ocean food web", "names": ["Plankton", "Krill", "Whale"], "text": "Plankton feeds Krill and Krill feeds Whale, standard stuff for class. Give me those arrows. The Whale should be huge and navy, and the Plankton tiny and lime. Which is the biggest shape, just so I check?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Plankton,Krill,Whale", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Whale", "size": "huge", "color": "navy"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Plankton", "size": "tiny", "color": "lime"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0208", "domain": "airline", "names": ["Gate", "Plane", "Runway"], "text": "The Plane starts at the Gate and ends at the Runway. A simple arrow does it, from Gate to Plane and Plane to Runway. I'd like the plane to be a triangle. Could you also tell me what's the position of the Runway?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Gate,Plane,Runway", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Plane", "shape": "triangle"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Runway", "property": "position"}}]}
{"id": "s-0209", "domain": "library", "names": ["Catalog", "Book1", "Book2"], "text": "Hmm, so, Catalog links to Book1 and also to Book2. Just ordinary arrows. Then I'd like to see everything arranged in a grid, it will look tidy. And the last thing: shade the first rectangle green.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Catalog", "to": "Book1,Book2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "layout": "grid"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "mention(recency=oldest,shape=rectangle)", "color": "green"}}]}
{"id": "s-0210", "domain": "solar power", "names": ["Panel", "Inverter", "Grid"], "text": "Panel to Inverter to Grid, that is the energy path. Chain them please. The Inverter is the weak point so mark it yellow. Also I need to know the neighbors of the Inverter, just to be sure it's linked properly.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Panel,Inverter,Grid", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Inverter", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Inverter"}}]}
{"id": "s-0211", "domain": "sports league", "names": ["Reds", "Blues", "Greens"], "text": "Reds should be red, Blues blue and Greens green, no more guesswork. Put the Reds to the left of the Blues. Then make a hexagon called Trophy in gold and place it between Blues and Greens. Is Trophy gold?", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Reds", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Blues", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Greens", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Reds", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Blues"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "hexagon", "color": "gold", "name": "Trophy", "position": "between", "anchor": "Blues,Greens"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "$new", "color": "gold"}}]}
{"id": "s-0212", "domain": "irrigation", "names": ["Well", "Pump", "Field"], "text": "Water comes from the Well through the Pump to the Field. Make the lines blue, since it's water. Two arrows, yes. The Pump is a small hexagon. Is the Field reachable from the Well?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Well,Pump,Field", "pairing": "chain", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pump", "shape": "hexagon", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "reachable", "from": "Well"}}]}
{"id": "s-0213", "domain": "photo studio", "names": ["Light", "Model"], "text": "Slap a tiny white star named Flash next to the Light, and a big purple ellipse named Backdrop at the far left. Join the Flash to the Model with a dotted arrow. Finally put the Model to the front.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "star", "color": "white", "size": "tiny", "name": "Flash", "position": "near", "anchor": "Light"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "ellipse", "color": "purple", "size": "large", "name": "Backdrop", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Flash", "to": "Model", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "Model"}}]}
{"id": "s-0214", "domain": "periodic table", "names": ["Na", "Cl", "Salt"], "text": "We'll show Na and Cl forming Salt. Draw arrows from both into the Salt. Na gets orange and Cl gets lime, if you don't mind. Then tell me, is the Salt linked to both?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Na,Cl", "to": "Salt"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Na", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cl", "color": "lime"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Salt"}}]}
{"id": "s-0215", "domain": "corporate", "names": ["Hq", "Lab", "Plant"], "text": "Get rid of the lab, they closed it down. Hook the Plant to the Hq with a solid arrow and make it large. Hq itself must be at the top of the canvas and indigo. How many shapes are left now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "Lab"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Plant", "to": "Hq"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Plant"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Hq", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hq", "color": "indigo"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
{"id": "s-0216", "domain": "hospital", "names": ["Bed1", "Bed2", "Nurse"], "text": "Duplicate Bed2 three times; the ward needs five beds. Then arrange all the squares in a row. The Nurse stays where she is, but make her pink. Honestly, that's all.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Bed2", "count": "3"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,shape=square)", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Nurse", "color": "pink"}}]}
{"id": "s-0217", "domain": "puppet theatre", "names": ["Puppet", "Curtain", "Lamp"], "text": "Curtain goes to the back, obviously. The Puppet needs to be in front, so bring it forward. Could you make the Lamp yellow and put it above the Puppet? Also, which shape is closest to the Lamp?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Curtain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "Puppet"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Lamp", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Lamp", "position": "above", "anchor": "Puppet"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Lamp", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0218", "domain": "mind map", "names": ["Career", "Skills"], "text": "I'm doing a career mind map, and I'd like 3 circles around Skills for the main strengths. Make them pink. Link every new circle to Skills, and link Skills to Career. And what do you think, is Skills the hub, as in the most connected?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "pink", "count": "3", "position": "near", "anchor": "Skills"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "mention(quantifier=all,recency=newest)", "to": "Skills"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Skills", "to": "Career"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}]}
{"id": "s-0219", "domain": "deployment", "names": ["Blue", "Green", "Router"], "text": "Router points to Blue, and Green is the standby. So connect the Router to Blue with a solid arrow and the Router to Green with a dashed one. Blue should be blue, funny enough, and Green green. We're migrating next week, so this is just the plan.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Router", "to": "Blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Router", "to": "Green", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Blue", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Green", "color": "green"}}]}
{"id": "s-0220", "domain": "classroom", "names": ["Group1", "Group2", "Group3"], "text": "Arrange the groups in a circle and give each one a different colour: Group1 red, Group2 blue, Group3 yellow. The room has to look lively. Does Group2 sit near Group3?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Group1,Group2,Group3", "layout": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Group1", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Group2", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Group3", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Group2", "position": "near", "anchor": "Group3"}}]}
{"id": "s-0221", "domain": "genealogy", "names": ["Grandma", "Mom", "Aunt"], "text": "Grandma has two daughters, Mom and Aunt. Connect Grandma to each of them. The Aunt is the youngest so make her small. Create a tiny cyan circle called Baby below Mom and draw a line from Mom to it.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Grandma", "to": "Mom,Aunt"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Aunt", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "cyan", "size": "tiny", "name": "Baby", "position": "below", "anchor": "Mom"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Mom", "to": "$new"}}]}
{"id": "s-0222", "domain": "vending machine", "names": ["Idle", "Coin", "Dispense"], "text": "State machine for a vending machine: Idle to Coin, Coin to Dispense, Dispense back to Idle. Do all three arrows. Give Dispense the color green. Then tell me, is there a cycle in it?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Idle,Coin,Dispense,Idle", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Dispense", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0223", "domain": "landscape", "names": ["Hill", "River", "House"], "text": "Make the Hill brown and large and put the House on top of it, I mean above. The River goes below the Hill and should be blue. How many brown things do we have?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hill", "color": "brown", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "House", "position": "above", "anchor": "Hill"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "River", "position": "below", "anchor": "Hill"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "River", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "color": "brown"}}]}
{"id": "s-0224", "domain": "code review", "names": ["Pr", "Review", "Merge"], "text": "From now on, anything I create should be medium sized. That's the new default for sizes. Add a diamond named Gate between Review and Merge and then connect Review to it and it to Merge. What rules do you have for me?", "wires": [{"type": "rule", "args": {"size": "medium"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "diamond", "name": "Gate", "position": "between", "anchor": "Review,Merge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Review,$new,Merge", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "rules"}}]}
{"id": "s-0225", "domain": "pharmacy", "names": ["Rx", "Pharmacist", "Patient"], "text": "The Rx goes to the Pharmacist, and from there to the Patient. I need arrows. The Patient is a circle in white, the Rx a small rectangle. Oh, forgot: label the Pharmacist \"verify\".", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Rx,Pharmacist,Patient", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Patient", "shape": "circle", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Rx", "shape": "rectangle", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Pharmacist", "label": "verify"}}]}
{"id": "s-0226", "domain": "game levels", "names": ["Lvl1", "Lvl2", "Lvl3", "Boss"], "text": "Chain the levels from Lvl1 to Boss in order. The Boss is the largest and red, and the three levels are all green. Is the Boss still the biggest?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Lvl1,Lvl2,Lvl3,Boss", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Boss", "size": "huge", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Lvl1,Lvl2,Lvl3", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0227", "domain": "campus map", "names": ["Library", "Gym", "Cafeteria"], "text": "Put the Gym far from the Library, so it goes to the bottom right. I want the Cafeteria to sit right next to the Library. What's the farthest thing from the Library then? And colour the Cafeteria orange.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Gym", "position": "bottomRight"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Cafeteria", "position": "near", "anchor": "Library"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Library", "superlative": "farthest"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cafeteria", "color": "orange"}}]}
{"id": "s-0228", "domain": "plumbing", "names": ["Tap", "Pipe", "Sink"], "text": "I'll start easy: the Pipe joins the Tap and the Sink. Connect Tap to Pipe, Pipe to Sink with plain lines. The pipe is long, so use a rectangle and make it large. The Sink should go to the bottom.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Tap,Pipe,Sink", "pairing": "chain", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pipe", "shape": "rectangle", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Sink", "position": "bottom"}}]}
{"id": "s-0229", "domain": "stock market", "names": ["Buy", "Hold", "Sell"], "text": "Three signals: Buy in green, Hold in yellow and Sell in red. Let the colors speak for themselves. After this, make the Hold shape a diamond and send it to the back. Is there a red shape on the board?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Buy", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hold", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Sell", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hold", "shape": "diamond"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Hold"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "color": "red"}}]}
{"id": "s-0230", "domain": "baby shower", "names": ["Gifts", "Cake", "Games"], "text": "Okay so everything needs to be pink or blue for the party. I'd go with Gifts pink, Cake blue, and Games pink. Also bring the cake forward, towards the front.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Gifts", "color": "pink"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cake", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Games", "color": "pink"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "Cake"}}]}
{"id": "s-0231", "domain": "api design", "names": ["Client", "Server"], "text": "Client calls Server and Server answers Client, so one two-way arrow. Put a navy diamond named Auth between them, and add the label \"token\" to it. I'd like to know the degree of the Server once you're done.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Client", "to": "Server", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "diamond", "color": "navy", "name": "Auth", "position": "between", "anchor": "Client,Server"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "$new", "label": "token"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "Server"}}]}
{"id": "s-0232", "domain": "zoo", "names": ["Monkey", "Parrot", "Snake"], "text": "Group the Monkey and the Parrot, since they live in the same house, with a plain line between them. Make the Snake a tiny green ellipse. Where's the Snake relative to the Monkey? Just curious.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Monkey", "to": "Parrot", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Snake", "shape": "ellipse", "size": "tiny", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Snake", "property": "position"}}]}
{"id": "s-0233", "domain": "project", "names": ["Plan", "Build", "Test", "Ship"], "text": "Just chain all four, Plan to Build to Test to Ship. Then, every box that isn't green should turn blue. Last thing, I'd like to hear which ones are blue.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Plan,Build,Test,Ship", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "mention(notcolor=green,quantifier=all,shape=rectangle)", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "color": "blue"}}]}
{"id": "s-0234", "domain": "circuit", "names": ["Switch", "Bulb"], "text": "My electronics class: put the Switch at the left and the Bulb at the right. Use a plain line from the Switch to the Bulb. The bulb is a yellow circle. And make the Switch one a gray square, it's a lever.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Switch", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Bulb", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Switch", "to": "Bulb", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bulb", "shape": "circle", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Switch", "shape": "square", "color": "gray"}}]}
{"id": "s-0235", "domain": "bakery", "names": ["Cake", "Pie", "Bread"], "text": "Cake, Pie, Bread. Turn all of them into circles, then arrange them in a row. I want the Pie to be huge, because it's the best seller. Does a gray one exist? There shouldn't be.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cake,Pie,Bread", "shape": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Cake,Pie,Bread", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pie", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "color": "gray"}}]}
{"id": "s-0236", "domain": "messaging", "names": ["Producer", "Topic", "Consumer"], "text": "Producer writes to Topic, Consumer reads from Topic. So the arrows go Producer to Topic, and Consumer to Topic... no wait, Topic to Consumer. Make the Topic a hexagon. Is Producer connected to Consumer directly?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Producer,Topic,Consumer", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Topic", "shape": "hexagon"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Producer", "anchor": "Consumer"}}]}
{"id": "s-0237", "domain": "gardening", "names": ["Rose", "Tulip", "Fern"], "text": "Rose is red, Tulip is yellow, Fern is green. Make it so. The rose is also a star in my drawing. Put the Fern at the bottom left, and tell me what the leftmost thing is.", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Rose", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Tulip", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Fern", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Rose", "shape": "star"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Fern", "position": "bottomLeft"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leftmost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0238", "domain": "audio", "names": ["Source", "Eq", "Output"], "text": "I want Source going to Eq and Eq going to Output. The EQ should be indigo, ok? Move the whole thing to the center. Give Output the label \"main\".", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Source,Eq,Output", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Eq", "color": "indigo"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "mention(quantifier=all)", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Output", "label": "main"}}]}
{"id": "s-0239", "domain": "fire station", "names": ["Alarm", "Truck", "Hydrant"], "text": "The Alarm calls the Truck, then the Truck reaches the Hydrant. Chain these and make the Alarm red. Also swap Truck and Hydrant, I got the order wrong in my head. Is the Truck near the Alarm?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Alarm,Truck,Hydrant", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Alarm", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "swap", "target": "Truck,Hydrant"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Truck", "position": "near", "anchor": "Alarm"}}]}
{"id": "s-0240", "domain": "company", "names": ["Hr", "Legal", "Finance"], "text": "HR, Legal and Finance all go into a grid. After that, I need Legal enlarged since they are overworked. Delete the red one. And how many shapes do we have afterwards?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Hr,Legal,Finance", "layout": "grid"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Legal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "mention(color=red)"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
{"id": "s-0241", "domain": "bridge", "names": ["Pier1", "Pier2", "Deck"], "text": "The Deck sits on top of both piers, so put it above Pier1 and join the Deck to Pier1 and Pier2 with plain lines. The piers should be brown and large. Is the Deck above Pier2 as well?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Deck", "position": "above", "anchor": "Pier1"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Deck", "to": "Pier1,Pier2", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pier1,Pier2", "color": "brown", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Deck", "position": "above", "anchor": "Pier2"}}]}
{"id": "s-0242", "domain": "yoga class", "names": ["Mat", "Block"], "text": "Mat and Block are all we have. Place 4 more small teal circles around them, as the students. Then I need to forget about the old defaults, they are stale. Show me the rules to verify.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "size": "small", "color": "teal", "count": "4", "position": "near", "anchor": "Mat"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "forget"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "rules"}}]}
{"id": "s-0243", "domain": "telecom", "names": ["Tower1", "Tower2", "Hub"], "text": "Connect Tower1 and Tower2 to Hub with arrows. Make the Hub huge, it carries all the traffic. I would love to see the towers evenly spread, can you distribute them vertically? What's the degree of Hub?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Tower1,Tower2", "to": "Hub"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hub", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Tower1,Tower2", "axis": "vertical"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "Hub"}}]}
{"id": "s-0244", "domain": "cooking class", "names": ["Chef", "Student1", "Student2"], "text": "Chef teaches both students, so a line from the Chef to each. Student2 is brand new, shrink them and paint them lime. Hmm, scratch that: just paint them lime. Where is the Chef, regarding the students?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Chef", "to": "Student1,Student2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Student2", "color": "lime"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Chef", "property": "position"}}]}
{"id": "s-0245", "domain": "video editing", "names": ["Clip1", "Clip2", "Fx"], "text": "Put the Fx between the two clips and tie Clip1 to Fx, and Fx to Clip2. The Fx is a star, and magenta. Please keep it small. Is the Fx the smallest here?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Fx", "position": "between", "anchor": "Clip1,Clip2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Clip1,Fx,Clip2", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Fx", "shape": "star", "color": "magenta", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "smallest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0246", "domain": "emergency services", "names": ["Dispatch", "Police", "Medic"], "text": "Dispatch sends the Police and the Medic. Two arrows out of Dispatch. Police should be navy and Medic should be white. Next, disconnect Dispatch from Police, I decided they don't belong. What's connected to the Dispatch?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Dispatch", "to": "Police,Medic"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Police", "color": "navy"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Medic", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "disconnect", "from": "Dispatch", "to": "Police"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Dispatch"}}]}
{"id": "s-0247", "domain": "math class", "names": ["Num", "Den"], "text": "We make fractions with shapes. Num sits above Den. Connect them with a plain line, and make them both white squares. Then create a gray circle called Line between them and tell me if that is the nearest to Num.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Num", "position": "above", "anchor": "Den"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Num", "to": "Den", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Num,Den", "shape": "square", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "gray", "name": "Line", "position": "between", "anchor": "Num,Den"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Num", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0248", "domain": "logistics", "names": ["Warehouse", "Truck1", "Truck2"], "text": "Warehouse feeds both trucks. I'd like them to be linked with arrows. Duplicate Truck1 once, we bought another truck. And make the new one orange. Are the trucks and the warehouse all connected?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Warehouse", "to": "Truck1,Truck2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Truck1"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "$new", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "reachable", "from": "Warehouse"}}]}
{"id": "s-0249", "domain": "town", "names": ["Bakery", "Bank", "Barber"], "text": "Make three tiny copies of ... no, duplicate the Bakery 2 times and shrink the copies. The Bank is the biggest building in town, make it huge. The Barber can be pink. Which is the biggest then?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Bakery", "count": "2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,recency=newest)"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bank", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Barber", "color": "pink"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0250", "domain": "onboarding", "names": ["Welcome", "Setup", "Tour"], "text": "Welcome leads to Setup and Setup leads to Tour. The arrows should be blue. Move the Tour to the right of the Setup. And label the Welcome \"hi\".", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Welcome,Setup,Tour", "pairing": "chain", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Tour", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Setup"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Welcome", "label": "hi"}}]}
